  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "There have been many worlds in VRChat that for some reason seem to only have a few items or small space that doesn't really have many items, the world size seems a little ridiculous at times as you would think it should be smaller.\nI found a world where there is a platform, bed, table, couch and two glasses which are the only things. The area is pretty small yet the world size is 81.44mbs. Users need to start learning to optimize their worlds file size so that you are not downloading 5-10 times the actual should be.\nThere needs to be an option for \"Environment - What is Wrong?\" and have it be called \"Unoptimized World Size\" since the only other option I could pick is Poor Performance but that doesn't really help me.\nWhat do you think?",
